# Dataset Rules

## Adding a Dataset
1. `src/dataset/my_dataset.py` — extend `BaseDataset`
2. `configs/dataset/my_dataset.yaml` — `_target_: dataset.my_dataset.MyDataset`
3. Update `src/dataset/README.md` and `src/dataset/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Remote Datasets
Check existing remote dataset infrastructure in `src/dataset/remote_dataset.py` and `src/dataset/dataset_server.py` before building custom loaders.
